msgstr "Spracheinstellung"

#: cui/classes/application.py:418
msgid "Language"
msgstr "Sprache"

#: cui/classes/application.py:419
msgid "Opens a dialog for selecting the system language via localectl."
msgstr "Öffnet einen Dialog zur Auswahl der Systemsprache über localectl."

#: cui/classes/application.py:421 cui/classes/handler.py:1003
#: cui/classes/handler.py:1053
msgid "Keyboard configuration"
msgstr "Tastatureinstellung"

#: cui/classes/application.py:423
msgid "Opens a dialog for selecting the console keyboard layout via localectl."
msgstr ""
"Öffnet einen Dialog zur Auswahl des Konsolen-Tastaturlayouts über localectl."

#: cui/classes/application.py:426
msgid "Change system password"
msgstr "Ändern des System Passworts"

#: cui/classes/application.py:427 cui/classes/application.py:467
msgid "Password change"
msgstr "Passwortänderung"

#: cui/classes/application.py:428
msgid ""
"Opens a dialog for changing the password of the system root user. When a "
"password is set, you can login via ssh and rerun grommunio-cui."
msgstr ""
"Öffnet einen Dialog um das System Passwort des root Benutzers anzupassen. "
"Ist das Passwort gesetzt, können Sie sich via ssh einloggen und dort "
"grommunio-cui erneut starten."

#: cui/classes/application.py:431
msgid "Network interface configuration"
msgstr "Netzwerkgerätekonfiguration"

#: cui/classes/application.py:432
msgid "Configuration of network"
msgstr "Konfiguration des Netzwerks"

#: cui/classes/application.py:433
msgid ""
"Opens a dialog to configure network interfaces (DHCP or static IPv4/IPv6, "
"gateway, DNS). Uses systemd-networkd, NetworkManager or wicked depending on "
"what is active."
msgstr ""
"Öffnet einen Dialog zur Konfiguration der Netzwerkschnittstellen (DHCP oder "
"statisches IPv4/IPv6, Gateway, DNS). Verwendet je nach Aktivität systemd-"
"networkd, NetworkManager oder wicked."

#: cui/classes/application.py:437
msgid "Change hostname"
msgstr "Rechnername ändern"

#: cui/classes/application.py:438
msgid "Hostname"
msgstr "Rechnername"

#: cui/classes/application.py:439
msgid "Opens a dialog for changing the system hostname via hostnamectl."
msgstr "Öffnet einen Dialog zum Ändern des Rechnernamens über hostnamectl."

#: cui/classes/application.py:442 cui/classes/handler.py:1075
#: cui/classes/handler.py:1123 cui/classes/handler.py:1131
