msgstr "Setup Assistent"

#: cui/classes/application.py:462
msgid ""
"Executes the grommunio-setup script for the initial configuration of "
"grommunio databases, TLS certificates, services and the administration web "
"user interface."
msgstr ""
"Führt das grommunio-setup Skript zur initialen Konfiguration der grommunio "
"Datenbanken, TLS Zertifikate, Dienste und des Administrationsweboberfläche."

#: cui/classes/application.py:468
msgid ""
"Opens a dialog for changing the password used by the administration web "
"interface."
msgstr ""
"Öffnet den Dialog zum Ändern des Passworts für die "
"Admistrationsweboberfläche."

